response.text:
Use each arrow to represent **energy moving from the organism being eaten to the organism that eats it**. Complete the starter web, then use the checkpoint to explain the direction.

```openui lifecycle=workspace id=grass-food-web

root = LearningSurface([foodWeb, checkpoint], "Grass Food Web", "Arrange the organisms and connect them in the direction that energy flows.", "workspace")
foodWeb = Diagram("grass-food-web-diagram", "Build the food web", "Move the four organisms into a useful arrangement. Add the missing feeding relationships as directed arrows labeled 'energy flows to'. Grass is the producer; the other organisms are consumers. Use the evidence in your diagram to show more than one pathway through the web.", [
  { id: "grass", label: "Grass", kind: "producer" },
  { id: "grasshopper", label: "Grasshopper", kind: "primary consumer" },
  { id: "frog", label: "Frog", kind: "secondary consumer" },
  { id: "heron", label: "Heron", kind: "predator" }
], [
  { id: "grass-to-grasshopper", from: "grass", to: "grasshopper", label: "energy flows to" }
], [
  { id: "all-organisms-present", label: "Includes all four organisms", type: "component", kind: "producer", minimum: 1 },
  { id: "grasshopper-present", label: "Includes a grasshopper", type: "component", kind: "primary consumer", minimum: 1 },
  { id: "frog-present", label: "Includes a frog", type: "component", kind: "secondary consumer", minimum: 1 },
  { id: "heron-present", label: "Includes a heron", type: "component", kind: "predator", minimum: 1 },
  { id: "producer-to-consumer", label: "Connects a producer to a consumer", type: "connection", fromKind: "producer", toKind: "primary consumer" },
  { id: "complete-path", label: "Provides a path from producer to predator", type: "path", fromKind: "producer", toKind: "predator" }
], [
  "Every organism appears exactly once.",
  "Arrows point from the food source toward the consumer.",
  "Each arrow is labeled 'energy flows to'.",
  "The diagram contains at least one complete pathway from grass to the heron.",
  "The web shows how more than one organism can receive energy from the same food source."
], "workspace", ["producer", "primary consumer", "secondary consumer", "predator"])
checkpoint = Question([
  { header: "Direction check", question: "In your completed food web, what does each arrow represent?", type: "text", hint: "Describe where the energy begins and where it goes." }
], "workspace", "Energy-flow direction", "Use your finished diagram to answer.")
```
